flowchart TB
    Client[React/Vite client]
    Auth[Supabase Auth]
    Proxy[Reverse proxy / rate limiter]
    API[Post creation FastAPI]
    Storage[(Supabase Storage)]
    Redis[(Redis Stream<br/>post_creation_stream)]
    Verifier[Post verifier worker]
    AI[AI analysis and embeddings]
    DB[(Supabase Postgres<br/>domain schema)]
    Feed[Feed service]
    Graph[Knowledge graph]
    GC[Orphan media garbage collector]

    Client --> Proxy
    Client --> Auth
    Proxy --> API
    Client -->|request signed URLs| API
    API -->|verify JWT| Auth
    API -->|create signed URLs| Storage
    Client -->|direct upload| Storage
    Client -->|submit text and media IDs| API
    API -->|XADD| Redis
    Redis -.->|planned consume| Verifier
    Verifier -.-> AI
    Verifier -.-> DB
    Verifier -.-> Storage
    DB -.-> Feed
    DB -.-> Graph
    GC -.-> Storage

